OL,3,GNEWSAFresh jail sentence for serial
OL,4,Achild sex abuser
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former teacher who is already serving
OL,7,Fa 23-year prison sentence for child sex
OL,8,Foffences has been sentenced again for
OL,9,Ffurther historical child sex abuse.
OL,11,FKeith Lockwood was jailed in May 2024
OL,12,Fafter being convicted of 23 offences
OL,13,Fagainst boys under the age of 16 in the
OL,14,F1970s, 80s and 90s in the Kirklees
OL,15,Farea.
