OL,3,GNEWSAFresh jail sentence for serial
OL,4,Achild sex abuser
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Leeds Crown Court on Tuesday,
OL,7,FLockwood, 72, was sentenced to a
OL,8,Ffurther 15 months in prison after being
OL,9,Ffound guilty at a trial in July of four
OL,10,Findecent assaults against two boys in
OL,11,FKirklees between the late 1970s and
OL,12,Fearly 1990s.
OL,14,FOne of his victims, who travelled from
OL,15,FNorth America to give evidence, had
OL,16,Ftold the latest trial Lockwood was
OL,17,F"solely responsible for taking my
OL,18,Fchildhood away".
